      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3>The problem</h3><p>Our endpoint took <strong>800ms</strong> on every call &amp; users noticed.</p><figure><img alt="" src="https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/1024/chart.png" /></figure><pre>from functools import lru_cache<br><br>@lru_cache<br>def get_config():<br>    return load()</pre><ul><li>Cache reads</li><li>Invalidate on write</li></ul><p>See <a href="https://example.com/docs">the docs</a>.</p><img src="https://medium.com/_/stat?event=post.clientViewed&amp;referrerSource=full_rss&amp;postId=1a2b3c4d5e6f" width="1" height="1" alt="">]]></content:encoded>
